//! PT-24: ARA 2 through CLAP, by ARA's own CLAP binding (ARACLAP.h in Celemony's ARA_API, Apache-2.0). This first step
//! reads a plug-in's ARA factories from its CLAP entry: what it is, which ARA generations it speaks, which content it
//! can analyze, how it transforms playback and how it archives its edits. Document control, analysis and playback
//! rendering build on it. ARA's C API itself is in ara_sys.rs (generated by bindgen from ARAInterface.h).
